        <mxCell id="flow-legend" value="Flow&#10;1. External client enters via the ingress Service&#10;2. Ingress Service routes to the app Service&#10;3. App Service to the Deployment&#10;4. App Deployment calls the data Service&#10;5. Data Service to the StatefulSet&#10;6. StatefulSet persists to its PersistentVolumeClaim&#10;7. API server admits the Deployment" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
